itle=\"Breath Powers\">Breath Powers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Hand_Blasts\" title=\"Hand Blasts\">Hand Blasts</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Optic_Blasts\" title=\"Optic Blasts\">Optic Blasts</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Torso_Blasts\" title=\"Torso Blasts\">Torso Blasts</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Projectile_Attacks\" title=\"Projectile Attacks\">Projectile Attacks</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Ball_Projection\" title=\"Absorption Ball Projection\">Absorption Ball Projection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Beam_Emission\" title=\"Absorption Beam Emission\">Absorption Beam Emission</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Blast_Attacks\" title=\"Blast Attacks\">Blast Attacks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bolt_Projection\" title=\"Bolt Projection\">Bolt Projection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bullet_Projection\" title=\"Bullet Projection\">Bullet Projection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Missile_Projection\" title=\"Missile Projection\">Missile Projection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Pillar_Projection\" title=\"Pillar Projection\">Pillar Projection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Spike_Projection\" title=\"Spike Projection\">Spike Projection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Strike_Projection\" title=\"Strike Projection\">Strike Projection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Vortex_Creation\" title=\"Vortex Creation\">Vortex Creation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Wave_Emission\" title=\"Wave Emission\">Wave Emission</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Trait:Special_Attacks\" title=\"Trait:Special Attacks\">Special Attacks</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Arcing_Blasts\" title=\"Arcing Blasts\">Arcing Blasts</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Cutting_Wave\" title=\"Cutting Wave\">Cutting Wave</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Expanding_Bolts\" title=\"Expanding Bolts\">Expanding Bolts</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Homing_Effect\" title=\"Homing Effect\">Homing Effect</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Manifested_Attacks\" title=\"Manifested Attacks\">Manifested Attacks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Multi-Shot\" title=\"Multi-Shot\">Multi-Shot</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Omnidirectional_Absorption_Waves\" title=\"Omnidirectional Absorption Waves\">Omnidirectional Absorption Waves</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Attack\" title=\"Personal Attack\">Personal Attack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Remote_Attacks\" title=\"Remote Attacks\">Remote Attacks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Scatter_Shot\" title=\"Scatter Shot\">Scatter Shot</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Wave_Motion_Blast\" title=\"Wave Motion Blast\">Wave Motion Blast</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other\">Other</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Attacks%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Attacks%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Combat\" title=\"Absorption Combat\">Absorption Combat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Powers\" title=\"Attack Powers\">Attack Powers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Energy Manipulation\">Energy Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Force-Field_Generation\" title=\"Force-Field Generation\">Force-Field Generation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Matter_Manipulation\" title=\"Matter Manipulation\">Matter Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Augmentation\" title=\"Power Augmentation\">Power Augmentation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Projectile_Enhancement\" title=\"Projectile Enhancement\">Projectile Enhancement</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Attacks%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May be limited to certain types of attacks.</li>\n<li>Users may require outside sources to release attacks.</li>\n<li>Users may not be immune to the effects of their own attacks.</li>\n<li>May be an involuntary reaction, or released in constant streams.</li>\n<li>May cause exhaustion or strain if too much effort is exerted at once.</li>\n<li>Users need control to avoid unnecessary destruction.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absorption Immunity\">Absorption Immunity</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Attacks%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://blackclover.fandom.com/wiki/Yami_Sukehiro\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:blackclover:Yami Sukehiro\">Yami Sukehiro</a> (<i>Black Clover</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bleach.fandom.com/wiki/Quincy\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:bleach:Quincy\">Quincy</a> (<i>Bleach</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bleach.fandom.com/wiki/%C5%8Cko_Yushima\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:bleach:Ōko Yushima\">Ōko Yushima</a> (<i>Bleach</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://digimon.fandom.com/wiki/Parallelmon\">Parallelmon</a> (<i>Digimon</i>)</li>\n<li>Users of the Life Drain Technique (<i>Gosu</i>)\n<ul><li>Gha Woobok</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dragonschef.fandom.com/wiki/Lloyd_Frontera\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:the-greatest-estate-developer:Lloyd Frontera\">Kim Suho/Lloyd Frontera</a> (<i>The Greatest Estate Developer</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://marvel.fandom.com/wiki/Carl_Creel_(Earth-616)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:marvel:Carl Creel (Earth-616)\">Carl Creel/Absorbing Man</a> (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://oots.fandom.com/wiki/\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:oots\">Various Characters</a> (<i>The Order of the Stick</i>)</li>\n<li>Users of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Category:HP-draining_moves\">HP-draining moves</a> (<i>Pokémon</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://return-of-the-crazy-demon.fandom.com/wiki/Lee_Jaha\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:return-of-the-crazy-demon:Lee Jaha\">Lee Jaha</a> (<i>Return of the Mad Demon</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Objects\">Known Objects</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Attacks%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D8&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Energon Harvesters (<i>Transformers: Fall of Cybertron/Transformers: Rise of the Dark Spark</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.